sox: sox (universal sound sample translator)
sox:
sox: SoX (Sound eXchange) is another Swiss Army knife of sound processing
sox: tools: it can convert sound files between many different file formats
sox: and audio devices, and can apply many sound effects & transformations.
sox: This version comes from the SoX_ng project which imports, compares,
sox: and refines bug fixes and new work from the many software
sox: distributions that package SoX and from the forks on github and
sox: elsewhere.
